# Deploy hygiene - working files must never ship (2026-09-07)
# `*.bak` does not match `index.html.pre_msskin.bak`'s siblings such as
# `llms.txt.bak-refresh-2026-09-07`; list what the scripts actually write.
*.bak
*.bak.*
*.bak-*
*.pre_*
*.tmp_write
*.preview
*.orig
_bak-archive/
__pycache__/
*.py
*.pyc
